components/tcp_transport/transport_ws.c

    A fork of ESP-IDF 5.5.5's components/tcp_transport/transport_ws.c.
    Copyright Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    Two local patches are applied. The exact diff against upstream is committed
    beside the file as components/tcp_transport/local.patch, and
    components/tcp_transport/check-patch.sh fails if the working copy has
    drifted from that recorded diff. See docs/notes/websocket-close-timeout.md
    for why the fork exists.

    Only this one file is vendored; its sibling sources and both include
    directories still come out of $IDF_PATH at build time.

